<div markdown="0">
  <figure id="reel-arrangement-example" class="arrangement-example" aria-labelledby="arrangement-caption">
    <div class="arrangement-panels">
      <section class="arrangement-panel" aria-labelledby="arrangement-a-title">
        <h5 id="arrangement-a-title">Arrangement A — Grouped</h5>
        <div class="arrangement-strips" aria-label="Reel strips: ABC, ABC, ABC">
          <div><span>Reel 1</span><strong>A → B → C</strong></div>
          <div><span>Reel 2</span><strong>A → B → C</strong></div>
          <div><span>Reel 3</span><strong>A → B → C</strong></div>
        </div>
        <p class="arrangement-label">Illustrative spin · all top symbols are A</p>
        <div class="arrangement-outcome"><span>Top</span><code>A A A</code><strong>Win · 1 coin</strong></div>
        <div class="arrangement-outcome"><span>Bottom</span><code>B B B</code><strong>Win · 1 coin</strong></div>
        <p class="arrangement-moments" id="arrangement-a-moments"></p>
      </section>
      <section class="arrangement-panel" aria-labelledby="arrangement-b-title">
        <h5 id="arrangement-b-title">Arrangement B — Rearranged</h5>
        <div class="arrangement-strips" aria-label="Reel strips: ABC, ACB, ABC. Only reel two changes.">
          <div><span>Reel 1</span><strong>A → B → C</strong></div>
          <div class="arrangement-changed"><span>Reel 2 · changed</span><strong>A → C → B</strong></div>
          <div><span>Reel 3</span><strong>A → B → C</strong></div>
        </div>
        <p class="arrangement-label">Illustrative spin · all top symbols are A</p>
        <div class="arrangement-outcome"><span>Top</span><code>A A A</code><strong>Win · 1 coin</strong></div>
        <div class="arrangement-outcome"><span>Bottom</span><code>B C B</code><span>No win · 0 coins</span></div>
        <p class="arrangement-moments" id="arrangement-b-moments"></p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <p class="small">
      The spins above illustrate one outcome per arrangement. The complete distributions below count all 27 equally likely stop combinations.
    </p>
    <div class="chart-legend"><span class="legend-one">Arrangement A</span><span class="legend-two">Arrangement B</span></div>
    <div id="arrangement-chart" class="chart"><p>Loading the exact payout distributions…</p></div>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <caption>
          Total payout probabilities · exact enumeration
        </caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Total payout</th>
            <th scope="col">Arrangement A</th>
            <th scope="col">Arrangement B</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="arrangement-probabilities"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <figcaption id="arrangement-caption">
      Only the middle reel's order changes. Symbol frequencies and expected payout stay the same; simultaneous wins and total variance change.
    </figcaption>
    <noscript>
      <p>
        JavaScript is required to enumerate and display this example. Arrangement A pays 0 or 2 coins; Arrangement B pays 0 or 1 coin. Both have an
        expected payout of 2/9 coins.
      </p>
    </noscript>
  </figure>
</div>
